menu "EKOS — Data Providers"

    config PROVIDER_BATTERY
        bool "Enable Battery ADC Provider"
        default y
        help
            Lit la tension batterie via ADC1_CH0 (GPIO1).
            Pont diviseur 680kΩ/150kΩ, LiPo 1S (3.0V–4.2V).
            Expose : battery_pct (float), battery_voltage (float).

    config PROVIDER_BME680
        bool "Enable BME680 Provider (I2C)"
        default n
        help
            Capteur environnemental Bosch BME680 via I2C (GPIO14/GPIO21).
            Expose : temperature (float), humidity (float),
                     pressure (float), gas_resistance (float).

endmenu
